{title: Show me Your glory}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Show me Your glory.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I need Your glory, I want Your glory
Less of me and more of You is what I need
Show me Your glory, Show me Your power
Less of me and more of You is what I need

{comment: Verse 1}
So many times I strayed away
Rejecting Your love and Your warm embrace
I realized that I need You more and more each day
